1
00:00:00,501 --> 00:00:02,001
(Raj:)You're welcome.

2
00:00:03,629 --> 00:00:06,259
Missy, I'm gonna go get my nails done.
Do you wanna come?

3
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:08,713
(Missy:)God, yes. Thanks.

4
00:00:08,884 --> 00:00:10,714
(Raj:)You're welcome.

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,890
- Bye, guys.
- Bye, Missy.

6
00:00:13,055 --> 00:00:14,225
(Leonard:)Bye, Missy, see you.

7
00:00:14,389 --> 00:00:17,599
- Goodbye, Leonard.
- Yeah, no, bye, Penny.

8
00:00:19,144 --> 00:00:22,104
(Howard:)- You two have to back off.
- Why should I back off? You back off.

9
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:25,442
(Leonard:)Excuse me, this is my apartment,
and she's my roommate's sister.

10
00:00:25,609 --> 00:00:28,069
- So what? You've got Penny.
- How do I have Penny?

11
00:00:28,237 --> 00:00:30,277
(Leonard:)In what universe do I have Penny?

12
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,950
- So I can have Penny?
- Hell, no.

13
00:00:35,118 --> 00:00:38,078
Excuse me, can I interject something?

14
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:42,164
(Sheldon:)I'm ordering pizza online.
Is everyone okay with pepperoni?

15
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:47,503
- Sheldon, can I talk to you in private?
- I guess.

16
00:00:48,048 --> 00:00:50,338
(Sheldon:)Don't worry,
I was going to order you cheese-less.

17
00:00:50,509 --> 00:00:51,839
- Thank you.
SHELDON: It's okay.

18
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:54,970
(Sheldon:)Lactose intolerance
is nothing to be embarrassed about.

19
00:00:56,807 --> 00:01:00,027
[IN INDIAN ACCENT] I'm a fancy
Indian man. We invented pajamas.

